Hi Mike,

Thank you for your extremely helpful response! I was able to successfully do the pairwise comparisons with advanced.procD.lm but am decidedly more interested in comparing >2 models at once.

model.comparison and anova.lm.rrpp won't work with objects of the class procD.lm, correct? Is there a way I can still account for phylogeny and compare multiple models with these functions?

Thank you very much,
Eve

